{"lines":[{"y":0.86482558112304564,"h":0.016083510138771739,"w":0.27631577435661764,"x":0.21240601914217999,"t":"(Hazel ate the bread in the house.)"},{"t":"3. Kinmaon hi Hazel","w":0.16541353113511031,"y":0.84590909095118327,"h":0.016009513681585097,"x":0.15601503729898625},{"w":0.18233082490808822,"t":"hin tinapay ha balay.","x":0.33458646496606875,"y":0.84727272687546318,"h":0.016099366274747062},{"t":"ma-verb +ICIA. +II CIO.","w":0.24624059340533089,"x":0.17105263283210909,"y":0.82994186008380144,"h":0.015988372455943645},{"x":0.44525700449233374,"y":0.82839613460785444,"t":"+ III CI L\/D\/B(location)","h":0.019408323114568526,"w":0.19409592572380518},{"y":0.79500000024202222,"t":"NOTE: This is the usual pattern though not every sentence will have all of these parts. Some will","x":0.15601506367547419,"h":0.019090909090909158,"w":0.76503755457261025},{"x":0.15413535750739424,"y":0.77761627924746624,"w":0.75563907398897057,"t":"not have an object; others will not have a location\/direction or beneficiary. Sometimes modifiers","h":0.017441860545765242},{"y":0.76000000007259916,"w":0.22368420769186581,"h":0.016363636363636358,"t":"or time cues are also added.","x":0.15413534162712467},{"x":0.15406781146161361,"w":0.10163881189682902,"h":0.016507704474709173,"t":"han and hin","y":0.72357754346646208},{"w":0.77067670036764702,"t":"In the example sentences above, the word han and the word hin are used in different ways. Before","h":0.01889534863558695,"y":0.68895348840022974,"x":0.15225562707181572},{"t":"the objects (saging, libro, tinapay), the hin and the han mark the object. The hin is translated \"a\"","x":0.15218200217407718,"y":0.67027555963871088,"w":0.76147654813878674,"h":0.020315186760642368},{"y":0.65681818166884565,"w":0.63533835018382345,"h":0.016363636363636358,"t":"(like an indefinite article), and the han is translated \"the\" (like a definite article).","x":0.15225563164367734},{"t":"BEFORE AN OBJECT:","x":0.212406017839918,"w":0.19924811868106615,"h":0.017727272727272592,"y":0.619090908846615},{"t":"hin-\"a\"","y":0.62043050918329201,"h":0.016406423395330272,"x":0.44730576375620612,"w":0.088471177045036709},{"x":0.4435416358082086,"h":0.017969155745072851,"y":0.60293402670155649,"w":0.11291672650505513,"t":"han -\"the\""},{"x":0.21052632217165745,"y":0.58272727237232691,"w":0.52255636776194847,"h":0.019090909090909047,"t":"[However, hin and han are often used interchangeably by Waray.]"},{"x":0.15225564923665996,"t":"The ha before the location word (tindahan, eskwelahan, balay) shows location. It functions like a","y":0.53181818209646603,"w":0.7631578871783089,"h":0.019090909090909047},{"t":"preposition and is usually translated \"in, on, or at.\"","y":0.51308139576035772,"h":0.020554968227039838,"w":0.40413534725413602,"x":0.15225563631967387},{"h":0.019106765226884259,"w":0.26503759047564346,"x":0.15225564250888882,"y":0.45909090915449924,"t":"II Class General Pronouns"},{"t":"In lesson 3 you learned the IClass General Pronouns (ini, iton, adto). These mark the topic. In","x":0.14849625606634939,"w":0.74812026079963234,"y":0.40681818203169084,"h":0.020507398952137379},{"w":0.44736841538373157,"y":0.39090909072997793,"x":0.14849623896226966,"h":0.020454545454545392,"t":"this lesson you will learn the II Class General Pronouns."},{"y":0.35174418641505945,"t":"II CLASS GENERAL PRONOUNS","x":0.3590225603081118,"w":0.31015036190257356,"h":0.021892177408391778},{"w":0.1204121847713695,"y":0.33697717109060088,"t":"FULL WORD","h":0.017906123074618252,"x":0.31385405874259464},{"y":0.336900762698914,"h":0.018058939847079181,"t":"MEANING","w":0.099802201214958641,"x":0.49991093046331436},{"y":0.31831395327362899,"h":0.017441860545765242,"w":0.037593985164866728,"x":0.31203007501155167,"t":"hini"},{"y":0.31517289427918171,"x":0.4980585689059705,"h":0.022270490472967031,"t":"this* (very near)","w":0.13734150606043199},{"w":0.052771386539234799,"h":0.017694915424693813,"t":"Hiton","x":0.31196017172141666,"y":0.30074556559638821},{"w":0.099624059340533144,"x":0.49812030138505031,"y":0.2949999995717778,"h":0.023313953226262951,"t":"that* (near)"},{"h":0.017441860545765242,"w":0.058270676556755496,"x":0.31015037602613349,"t":"Hadto","y":0.28197674397130346},{"t":"that* \"over there\" (far)","y":0.28045454554076166,"x":0.49999999693659125,"w":0.18609023150275739,"h":0.021871035315773724},{"h":0.021818181818181848,"x":0.14849623142071069,"y":0.24272727234795144,"t":"* The meaning is the same as the I Class (ini, iton, adto), but the usage is different. The Il Class","w":0.75375940659466911},{"w":0.59586465274586398,"t":"functions either like a direct object or a possession word in ma-actor focus.","x":0.14849624724414645,"y":0.22674418643380745,"h":0.020528541044755433},{"y":0.19040697730895484,"w":0.38721805348115801,"x":0.15037593676192715,"h":0.021865750226107483,"t":"Examples: (II Class General Pronouns)"},{"t":"1. Mapalit hi Ruth hiton nga libro ha Alemars.","w":0.36654135311351105,"y":0.16272727270897636,"h":0.020454545454545503,"x":0.14849624218384599},{"t":"2. Mabasa hiya hiton nga Bibliya ha simbahan.","w":0.36466164981617644,"y":0.14818181810914377,"h":0.016062368046153686,"x":0.14849623911446816},{"w":0.34406264361213235,"h":0.018380877754905045,"y":0.13034444502482323,"t":"3. Mabalhin hira Joel ngan hi Anna hini nga","x":0.14845740253522682},{"w":0.053006250718060643,"y":0.10869633358949593,"t":"balay.","h":0.019525937167080953,"x":0.14830890512654318},{"x":0.14661654209532907,"w":0.36842105641084566,"t":"4. Linmingkod an mga bata hiton nga bangko.","y":0.093023255945910988,"h":0.018895348635586839},{"y":0.16409090902237256,"h":0.019090909090909158,"w":0.28571427289177398,"x":0.54323309149897525,"t":"Ruth will buy that book at Alemars."},{"y":0.14534883737436177,"x":0.54135338648603359,"t":"He read that Bible at the church.","h":0.021923889680342312,"w":0.26315788717830879},{"y":0.12936046556171443,"t":"Joel and Anna will move in this house.","h":0.020348836725408326,"x":0.5413533905470046,"w":0.30827065860523895},{"h":0.018895348635586839,"y":0.094476744226295595,"x":0.54135338464118266,"t":"The children sat on this chair.","w":0.23872179816750927}],"w":1700,"h":2200}